			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Consolidate Vine gRPC service trait imports\n\nRedirect the `CocoonService` and `MountainService` trait imports to use the canonical definitions from the `::Vine::Generated` namespace, removing the redundant local re-exports from `Source/Vine/Generated/mod.rs`.\n\nThe imports in `Source/RPC/CocoonService/mod.rs` and `Source/Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs` now point directly to `::Vine::Generated::cocoon_service_server::CocoonService` and `::Vine::Generated::mountain_service_server::MountainService` respectively, eliminating the intermediate path through the local `crate::Vine::Generated` module.\n\nThis finalizes the migration to the shared Vine library for gRPC service definitions, ensuring Mountain delegates all RPC interface contracts to the canonical source.",
			"SHA": "123bf22d7ad191d28dbbedebd3ed3653c58acabe"
		},
